claim.claim-text:
rotating the steering wheel in a first direction or a second direction;
detecting a load on a reaction force motor of the steering device while rotating the steering wheel in the first direction or the second direction;
temporarily storing, when an increase in the load on the reaction force motor is detected, an end angle that is the steering angle when the increase is detected; and
determining the steering angle based on the end angle, wherein
the temporarily storing the end angle is temporarily storing a first end angle when the steering wheel is rotated in the first direction and then temporarily storing a second end angle when the steering wheel is rotated in the second direction.
